  "open_questions": [
    "Shell identifies Risella X 415 as a GTL-derived technical white/process oil, but no explicit grade-specific API base-oil Group classification has been verified. API Group remains Missing.",
    "Chemistry is supported by the historical TDS DL2-13728.pdf: GTL-derived hydrocarbon fluid, highly saturated with a high degree of iso-paraffinic structures. Shell's newer official TDS also describes the product as a highly refined paraffinic process oil made using GTL technology.",
